---
const MEDICAL_DIRECTOR = 'Medical Director: Joshua Shaw, MD · FL Lic. ME136232';
---

<section
  data-service-education
  data-injectables-hub-overview
  class="border-t border-gold-metal/10 bg-charcoal px-6 py-[clamp(56px,8vw,96px)]"
>
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-[1180px]">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.85fr_1.15fr] lg:gap-24">
      <div>
        <span class="kicker">Injectables &amp; Bio-Fillers</span>
        <h2 class="mt-3 max-w-[560px] font-serif text-[clamp(32px,5vw,50px)] leading-[1.08] text-ink">
          Notice whether the change is in movement, fullness, or the under-eye area.
        </h2>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-5 text-[17px] leading-[1.75] text-muted-strong">
        <p>
          House of Rose offers neurotoxins for movement-related lines, hyaluronic-acid fillers for
          selected areas of lost volume, and injectable PRF prepared from a small sample of your own
          blood.
        </p>
        <p>
          A line that changes with expression differs from a cheek or fold that looks less full. An
          under-eye concern can involve visible color, vessels, or shadow, and those do
          not all point to injectable PRF. Describe what you notice and whether it changes with
          expression; that distinction is a more useful starting point than choosing a product name.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-px bg-gold-metal/15 lg:grid-cols-3">
      <article class="bg-charcoal-light p-7 sm:p-9">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-[24px] text-ink">Neurotoxin injections</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted">
          Neurotoxins address lines that appear or deepen when you frown, raise your brows, or squint.
          Botox and Daxxify use product-specific units, so their unit counts are not interchangeable.
        </p>
        <div class="mt-6 flex flex-wrap gap-x-6 gap-y-3">
          <a href="/services/injectables/" class="learn-more hover:text-gold">
            Neurotoxin Injections
          </a>
          <a href="/compare/daxxify-vs-botox/" class="learn-more hover:text-gold">
            Compare Daxxify and Botox
          </a>
        </div>
      </article>

      <article class="bg-charcoal-light p-7 sm:p-9">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-[24px] text-ink">Hyaluronic-acid fillers</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted">
          For lost volume in selected lip, cheek, and fold areas, House of Rose offers Juvéderm Ultra
          XC, Juvéderm Voluma XC, RHA 1, RHA 2, and RHA 3. The area, tissue movement, and intended
          change help determine which product may be relevant.
        </p>
        <a href="/services/dermal-fillers/" class="learn-more mt-6 inline-block hover:text-gold">
          Dermal Fillers
        </a>
      </article>

      <article class="bg-charcoal-light p-7 sm:p-9">
        <h3 class="font-serif text-[24px] text-ink">Injectable PRF</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted">
          Injectable PRF is prepared from a small sample of your own blood. House of Rose offers two
          distinct uses: PRF Under-Eye and PRF Bio-Filler. They are not interchangeable with topical PRF.
        </p>
        <a href="/services/prf-injections/" class="learn-more mt-6 inline-block hover:text-gold">
          Injectable PRF
        </a>
      </article>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 grid gap-8 border-t border-gold-metal/20 pt-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16">
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-[25px] text-ink">When PRF stays at the skin surface</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted">
          With eligible Microneedling treatments, PRF is applied to the skin surface rather than injected.
          <a href="/services/microneedling/" class="text-gold underline-offset-4 hover:underline">
            See topical PRF with Microneedling.
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3 class="font-serif text-[25px] text-ink">Who provides injectable treatments?</h3>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted-strong">
          Diana Morrison, RN provides these injectable services under written physician protocol and
          medical direction. Her profile explains the services she provides and the role behind the
          credential.
        </p>
        <a href="/about/providers/diana/" class="learn-more mt-5 inline-block hover:text-gold">
          Meet Diana Morrison, RN
        </a>
        <p class="mt-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed text-muted">{MEDICAL_DIRECTOR}</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-12 border border-gold-metal/20 bg-charcoal-light p-7 sm:p-9">
      <div class="grid gap-5 lg:grid-cols-[1fr_auto] lg:items-center lg:gap-12">
        <div>
          <h3 class="font-serif text-[25px] text-ink">Describe the change, not a product.</h3>
          <p class="mt-3 max-w-[760px] text-[15px] leading-[1.75] text-muted-strong">
            If movement, volume, and the under-eye area seem to overlap, note what you see and whether
            it changes with expression. That observation gives the provider a clearer place to begin.
          </p>
        </div>
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn-outline justify-self-start lg:justify-self-end">
          Contact House of Rose
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
